    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "Khavarannama Metropolitan Museum of Art Collection is a collection of manuscripts and artworks related to the Khavarannama, a Persian epic poem. This collection includes various folios and illustrations that depict the adventures of Ali ibn Abi Talib and other legendary figures. The collection is hosted by the Metropolitan Museum of Art and is available under a Creative Commons license."
        ]
    },
